        "text": "<thinking> To fetch a database connection secret at runtime, I will use AWS Secrets Manager as the external provider. This service allows secure storage and retrieval of secrets such as database credentials. The AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) will be used to interact with the service. The script will import the Boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and use it to fetch the secret. The script will be identifiable as using AWS Secrets Manager by the import statement and the use of the `get_secret_value` method. </thinking>\n",
