      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To fetch an API key from a managed secrets store, I need to use a concrete external provider. AWS Secrets Manager is a suitable choice for this task. I will write a Python script that uses the AWS SDK (Boto3) to interact with AWS Secrets Manager and retrieve the API key. The script will be named `fetch_api_key.py` and will be created in the current working directory. </thinking>\n",
